  "id": "spatial-vision",
  "term": "spatial vision",
  "definition": "Spatial vision refers to visual abilities involved in resolving fine detail and detecting contrast, such as visual acuity and contrast sensitivity. In this packet, it is discussed as a domain that can show deficits in amblyopia.",
